{"updated":"2026-09-05T05:57:01.016Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: US imposes sanctions on Turkish bank, prompting legal threat. Elsewhere, families of missing Ecuadorian fishermen allege US involvement. And middle East live: Israeli strikes on south and east Lebanon kill three people. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Israel, and Russia are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 0.2 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 1.2 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.3 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 66 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.5 near 156 km E of Kuril’sk, Russia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.29,0.34,0.38,0.42,0.46,0.51,0.55,0.57,0.6,0.63,0.67,0.8,0.92,1.09,1.47,1.59,1.65,1.67,1.7,1.74,1.76,1.79,1.81,1.86,1.9,1.99,2.04,2.09,2.13,2.16,2.21,2.25,2.29,2.35,2.39,2.44,2.47,2.52,2.57,2.62,2.68,2.74,2.81,2.88,2.95,3.06,3.16,3.31,3.33,3.38,3.41,3.47,3.51,3.58,3.69,3.79,3.85,3.94,3.99,4.06,4.11,4.17,4.21,4.24,4.27,4.33,4.35,4.38,4.4,4.45,4.49,4.57,4.63,4.7,4.76,4.82,4.89,4.92,4.98,5,5.06,5.18,5.33,5.5,6.11,6.32,6.56,6.63,6.7,6.78,6.85,7,7.07,7.19,7.22,7.28,7.33,7.41,7.45,7.52,7.57,7.62,7.66,7.72,7.78,7.86,7.93,7.98,8.05,8.12,8.2,8.26,8.31,8.37,8.42,8.46,8.52,8.58,8.67,8.75,8.85,8.97,9.13,9.2,9.24,9.28,9.32,9.37,9.43,9.48,9.51,9.54,9.63,9.67,9.75,9.81,9.87,9.91,9.97,10,10.06,10.12,10.18,10.25,10.37,10.48,10.81,10.93,10.99,11.04,11.1,11.13,11.18,11.23,11.27,11.37,11.41,11.47,11.55,11.64,11.7,11.75,11.78,11.83,11.88,11.9,11.95,11.98,12,12.07,12.11,12.15,12.19,12.25,12.31,12.34,12.36,12.45,12.54,12.61,12.65,12.72,12.78,12.9,12.97,13.04,13.1,13.13,13.21,13.26,13.34,13.37,13.42,13.44,13.49,13.55,13.62,13.68,13.88,14,14.05,14.09,14.19,